      "why_not": "window-1 carries no post-type label. The post-type head was gated on the frozen test set and never run over this window's posts: the window's post leg is the POSITION instrument (`positions_text_gm4`, 44 rows over 10 channels), and its replies are position lists, not post types. So this silencer would remove exactly 0 threads of the window's total — not because giveaway threads are absent, but because nothing in the store can name one"
